			"id":"58c9ae00489650cb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Guide\n\n1. There is a room on the west wing that is called the [[014 - Garage.canvas|014 - Garage]].\n2. If you draft it and you power it through the [[031 - Utility Closet.canvas|031 - Utility Closet]] or [[032 - Boiler Room.canvas|032 - Boiler Room]], you are able to open the garage door.\n3. This unlocks the west gate, allowing you to access the west path and also unlocks a permanent upgrade named [[Outer Room.canvas|Outer Room]].\n4. This room allows you to draft outer rooms to apply special effects into your current run.",
